      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Sales rep visited property and inspected site. Made appointment and arrived at agreed time. Quotation was detailed and was delivered by email on time. Quotation showed sufficient detail to enable me to make an informed decision.Installers arrived on time and erected panels after discussing siting of  panels and inverter. Their professional knowledge assisted me re siting of panels for best electricity generation.Workmen were courteous and cleaned up after the job.Communication between company and client could be improved. Most communication was driven by me. Always courteous and obliging.Discussions re power board upgrade with electricity supplier was left to client. After many hours and many emails and phone calls this horrendous activity has been moved to the stage where I am waiting for the electricity company to do the upgrade to enable connection. I have a solar system but NO solar power as yet as I’m still waiting for power company to set a date to do upgrade.",
